1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,140
Beyond Neptune, cold worlds drift in the dark.

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:07,130
NASA's SPHEREx maps the whole sky in infrared.

3
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:08,470
This is MIRA.

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:13,080
Point anywhere. Watch twenty-seven years play.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,540
See what moved, and how fast.

6
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:19,170
Read its light. This one shows methane.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,150
A sky model forecasts where it goes next.

8
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,810
Seventeen thousand stars, caught moving.

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,130
MIRA. See what moved. Measure it.

